    <section class="section experience" id="approach"><div class="container experience-layout"><div class="fade-up"><div class="section-label">03 / Our approach</div><h2>From models<br>to motion.</h2><p>We integrate physical modeling, learning-based decision making, perception, and control in a unified research pipeline — and validate new ideas through simulation and experimental robotic systems.</p><div class="exp-list"><div class="exp-line"><span>01 &nbsp; Understand the environment</span><span>Perception + World Models</span></div><div class="exp-line"><span>02 &nbsp; Learn the task</span><span>VLA + Reinforcement Learning</span></div><div class="exp-line"><span>03 &nbsp; Execute with precision</span><span>Planning + Feedback Control</span></div><div class="exp-line"><span>04 &nbsp; Validate and improve</span><span>Simulation + Experiments</span></div></div></div><div class="exp-art fade-up"><img src="assets/world-model.svg" alt="Illustration of interconnected states in a predictive robot world model"></div></div></section>
