</div><div><small>Principal Investigator</small><h3>Prof. Ting Zou</h3><p>Associate Professor, Department of Mechanical and Mechatronics Engineering, Memorial University of Newfoundland. Research in bio-inspired robotics, robot design and control, and learning-enabled autonomous systems.</p><a href="https://wp.mun.ca/romecola/people/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View full profile ↗</a></div></div><h3 class="member-heading">Graduate researchers</h3><div class="member-grid fade-up"><div class="member"><div class="member-avatar">CM</div><div><small>Doctoral researcher</small><h4>Chidiebere Sobechukwu Metu</h4></div></div><div class="member"><div class="member-avatar">JL</div><div><small>Doctoral researcher</small><h4>Jiaoyang Lu</h4></div></div><div class="member"><div class="member-avatar">YG</div><div><small>Doctoral researcher</small><h4>Yaru Gu</h4></div></div></div><p class="people-note">Team roster reproduced from the currently public People page for prototype purposes; current membership, photographs, and new arrivals should be confirmed before launch.</p></div></section>
